{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"平坦函子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"平坦函子"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>平坦函子可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦模","text":"平坦模"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过米田扩张</h3>\n<p>对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$, 考虑其"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"米田扩张"}},{"Plain":" $F\\otimes (-)\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$; 若后者为左正合函子, 即保持有限极限, 则称 $F$ 为<strong>平坦函子</strong>.</p>\n<p>换言之, 平坦函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"预层意象","text":"预层意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的点","text":"点"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>通过元素范畴</h3>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 平坦当且仅当 $F$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"元素范畴","text":"元素范畴"}},{"Plain":"为"},{"Local":{"url":"余滤范畴","text":"余滤范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关资料</h2>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"盲人摸象","text":"盲人摸象"}},{"Plain":" A.5 节.</p>\n"}]}}